---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
import Hero from '../components/ui/Hero.astro';
import Badge from '../components/ui/Badge.astro';
import Card from '../components/ui/Card.astro';
import { responsive } from '../lib/responsive';
import { deepdiveUrl } from '../lib/deepdive';
import { BOOKING_URL, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../lib/distributor';

// /about/ names no fund, so it may link to /invest/ and the booking page (handoff §2, Links).
const lightLink = 'font-semibold text-fi-link underline decoration-fi-link/40 hover:decoration-fi-link';

const rules = [
  {
    title: 'Evidence before opinion',
    body: 'Public data, standard measures and clear calculations. No star ratings and no black boxes. Our method is public, so you can check our work.',
    icon: '<path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 16l4-8 4 5 5-6"/>',
  },
  {
    title: 'Research kept apart from selling',
    body: 'Our fund investigations and Deepdive have no buy buttons and never link to our service. They show the evidence, and you keep the decision.',
    icon: '<path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M5 8h4M5 12h4M15 8h4M15 12h4"/>',
  },
  {
    title: 'Open about how we are paid',
    body: "When you invest through us, the fund house pays us a commission from the regular plan's expense ratio. We show it on each fund before you invest.",
    link: { href: '/invest/#costs', label: 'See the costs →' },
    icon: '<path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>',
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="About Fund Investigator: Evidence-Based Fund Analysis"
  description="Why Fund Investigator exists: we investigate mutual funds with evidence, then help you choose and invest with the same checks and our costs shown first."
>
  <Hero size="md" background="dark" class="fi-about-hero">
    <div class="fi-about-grid pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <Badge variant="dark" class="mb-6">About Fund Investigator</Badge>
    <h1 class:list={[responsive.display, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-6']}>
      <span class="text-fi-ink-inv">Why</span>
      <span class="text-fi-gold">Fund Investigator</span>
      <span class="text-fi-ink-inv">Exists</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-body-lg text-fi-muted-inv leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      We investigate mutual funds with evidence, not ratings. Then we help you choose and invest, with the same checks and our costs shown first.
    </p>
  </Hero>

  <Section background="white" spacing="md" maxWidth="md">
    <div class="border-l-4 border-fi-gold pl-6 md:pl-8">
      <Badge class="mb-6">Our Story</Badge>
      <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink mb-6']}>The Question We Start With</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        Mutual fund research often shrinks to one question: what returned the most? That number matters, but it does not explain the path. A fund can lead because it took more risk, bet on a passing theme, or rode a market phase.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        We started Fund Investigator to separate the result from the reasons. We check risk, falls, benchmark behaviour and style drift before we form a view. We built Deepdive so anyone can run the same checks.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        The same problem appears when people invest. Too often, funds are sold, not chosen: on last year's returns, on a new fund launch, or on what pays the seller most. Fund distribution is usually run as sales, not as analysis. That is how mis-selling happens.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body-md text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-fi-ink">So we offer distribution that starts with analysis.</strong> As an AMFI-registered Mutual Fund Distributor, we use the same evidence to help you choose suitable funds. We show what we earn on each one before you invest.
      </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section background="light" spacing="md" maxWidth="2xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16">
      <Badge class="mb-6">How We Work</Badge>
      <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink leading-tight tracking-tight']}>Three rules we keep.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 lg:gap-8">
      {rules.map((rule, index) => (
        <Card padding="lg" hover={false} class={index === rules.length - 1 ? 'sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1' : ''}>
          <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-fi-icon-bg rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-fi-icon h-fi-icon text-fi-muted" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" set:html={rule.icon} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-heading-sm font-bold text-fi-ink mb-3">{rule.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-fi-muted leading-relaxed">
            {rule.body}
            {rule.link && <>{' '}<a href={rule.link.href} class={lightLink}>{rule.link.label}</a></>}
          </p>
        </Card>
      ))}
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Two ways we help: both routes side by side, one gold action -->
  <Section background="white" spacing="md" maxWidth="lg">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <Badge class="mb-6">Two ways we help</Badge>
      <h2 class:list={[responsive.h2, 'font-bold text-fi-ink leading-tight tracking-tight max-w-72 sm:max-w-3xl mx-auto']}>
        Invest with our support, or investigate on your own.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 lg:gap-8">
      <Card variant="elevated" padding="lg" hover={false} class="flex flex-col">
        <h3 class="text-heading-sm font-bold text-fi-ink mb-3">Invest with Support</h3>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-fi-muted leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
          We look at your funds with you, help you choose suitable ones, and review them at regular intervals. Start with a 30-minute portfolio review call.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3">
          <Button
            href={BOOKING_URL}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            icon="external"
            track={{ event: 'review_booking_click', placement: 'about' }}
            class="w-full sm:w-auto"
          >
            Book a portfolio review
          </Button>
          <a href="/invest/" class:list={[lightLink, 'text-body-sm']}>How support works →</a>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <Card padding="lg" hover={false} class="flex flex-col">
        <h3 class="text-heading-sm font-bold text-fi-ink mb-3">Investigate on your own</h3>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-fi-muted leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
          Read our investigations, or use Deepdive to check any fund against a fair benchmark. Choose direct plans and keep every decision.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3">
          <Button
            href={deepdiveUrl('about')}
            variant="secondary"
            surface="light"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            icon="external"
            track={{ event: 'deepdive_click', placement: 'about' }}
            class="w-full sm:w-auto"
          >
            Open Deepdive
          </Button>
          <a href="/reports/" class:list={[lightLink, 'text-body-sm']}>Read our investigations →</a>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-body-sm text-fi-muted mt-10">
      Questions? <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class={lightLink}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
    </p>
  </Section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .fi-about-hero {
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .fi-about-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.14;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.14) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(203, 213, 225, 0.14) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 64px 64px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, black 18%, black 70%, transparent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .fi-about-grid {
      background-size: 48px 48px;
      opacity: 0.1;
    }
  }
</style>
